---
import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Text } from "~/components/primitives";
---

<Layout title="Vladimir Infante Dev - About">
  <main class="container pb-14 pt-32">
    <div class="autoShowRight2WithoutTimeline mb-12 opacity-0">
      <Text element="h1" className="pb-6 text-5xl font-semibold"
        >Hello! I'm Vladimir 👋</Text
      >
    </div>
    <section
      class="slideBotToTopAnimation w-full space-y-6 opacity-0"
      style={{
        "--delay": "0.3s",
      }}
    >
      <Text element="p" className="pb-6 text-xl">
        I am a self-taught Full-Stack Developer from Venezuela who loves
        building functional and user-friendly web applications. Over the years,
        I've worked on everything from e-commerce platforms and custom
        dashboards to AI-powered tools and e-learning platforms. I really enjoy
        solving problems with tools like React, Next.js, TypeScript, and I'm
        equally comfortable working on the back-end with Node.js (Express.js),
        PostgreSQL, Redis, Django and FastAPI.
      </Text>
      <Text element="p" className="pb-6 text-xl">
        I enjoy diving into new technologies and experimenting with tools to
        improve my skills and workflows. Whether it's optimizing API
        performance, setting up CI/CD pipelines with GitHub Actions, or building
        an intuitive front-end, I'm all about creating efficient and
        maintainable solutions.
      </Text>
      <Text element="p" className="pb-6 text-xl">
        When I'm not coding, I'm probably tweaking personal projects, exploring
        new ways to solve problems, or enjoying hobbies like photography and
        learning new languages.
      </Text>
      <Text element="p" className="pb-6 text-xl">
        Let's build something awesome together!
      </Text>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
